    home_draw_map: '🗺️ Prefer to draw your area on the map?', home_bedrooms_inline: 'bedrooms', home_wc_inline: 'baths', pricem2_calculating: 'Calculating...', pricem2_view_button: 'View price per m²',
    faq_title: 'Frequently asked questions', faq_q1: 'How do I publish a property?', faq_a1: 'Create an account, click "Publish property" and fill in the form. Your listing stays "under review" until approved by our team.', faq_q2: 'Is it free to publish?', faq_a2: 'For individual users, yes — it\'s free to publish up to 3 listings. For agencies, publishing costs €15 per month, with up to 50 simultaneous listings.', faq_q3: 'How do I contact a property\'s advertiser?', faq_a3: 'On the property page, use the contact form — if you\'re logged in, the conversation is saved in your chat.', faq_q4: 'Can I edit or delete a listing after publishing?', faq_a4: 'Yes, in your dashboard you\'ll find the options to edit, deactivate or delete each listing.', faq_q5: 'What is "featuring" a listing?', faq_a5: 'It\'s a way to give your property more visibility in search results. You can activate it directly from your dashboard.', faq_q6: 'How do I report a suspicious listing?', faq_a6: 'On the property page, there\'s a "Report this listing" button. Our team reviews every report.',
